{"id":"653211","name":"蛋炒饭","author":"加菲猫私厨","authorId":"12920939","desc":"","cover":"images/653211/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"1盘"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"火腿","amount":"50g"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"1/2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"盘剩米饭。","img":"images/653211/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"个鸡蛋炒熟划散。","img":"images/653211/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"克火腿切粒、1个小乳瓜切粒、半个老玉米煮熟剥成粒。","img":"images/653211/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅内喷薄油，爆香葱蒜片。","img":"images/653211/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入米饭炒匀。","img":"images/653211/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入配菜翻炒均匀。","img":"images/653211/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入1小勺盐、1小勺自制魔法盐（前面有介绍https://m.meishichina.com/recipe/644256/）。","img":"images/653211/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入鸡蛋翻炒均匀。","img":"images/653211/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入适量青菜叶（菜心最佳）。","img":"images/653211/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒至青菜断生即可。","img":"images/653211/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"【蛋炒饭】香喷喷～","img":"images/653211/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"根据个人口味调整用料和用量！ \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}